{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o007a","title":"灵帝崩后太子即位","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o007a-account","label":"正文","text":"灵帝去世，太子刘辩即位，何太后临朝。","evidence":["wudi-e-o007a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0025","role":"去世","evidence":["wudi-e-o007a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0049","role":"即位","evidence":["wudi-e-o007a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0050","role":"临朝","evidence":["wudi-e-o007a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"中平六年","year":189,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o007a-q","wudi-q-o008","wudi-q-b-c8312ddce42041c69855"],"chronology":"wudi-y189","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o008","basis":"中平六年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,61,"O007a"],"order":38}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0025","name":"汉灵帝","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0049","name":"刘辩","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0050","name":"何太后","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o007a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-50b64ee18ec5610ba8a9","layer":"original","quote":"会灵帝崩，太子即位〖3〗，太后临朝〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-c8312ddce42041c69855","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c8312ddce42041c69855","layer":"modern","quote":"〖14〗杀太后及弘农王：董卓杀何太后在中平六年（公元 189），但杀弘农王则在第二年的正月。见《后汉书》卷八《灵帝纪》、卷九《献帝纪》。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-449cc7b499c8a1fee35c","start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o008","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9faaac9907c958c4d4d1","layer":"original","quote":"卓到，废帝为弘农王而立献帝〖7〗，京都大乱。卓表太祖为骁骑校尉〖8〗，欲与计事。太祖乃变易姓名，间行东归〖9〗；﹝二﹞出关〖10〗，过中牟〖11〗。为亭长所疑〖12〗，执诣县。邑中或窃识之〖13〗，为请得解。﹝三﹞卓遂杀太后及弘农王〖14〗。太祖至陈留〖15〗，散家财，合义兵，将以诛卓。冬十二月，始起兵于己吾〖16〗。﹝四﹞是岁，中平六年也。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":172,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
